<title>POLAND: Poland ups price range for KGHM copper concern IPO.</title>
<headline>Poland ups price range for KGHM copper concern IPO.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Treasury Ministry on Friday changed the price range for the initial public offering of copper concern KGHM Polska Miedz SA to 18-23 zlotys per share from 15-23 zlotys per share, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
